Fly out!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.020
From now on, you, yourself, can take down monsters!

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:40.700
The Squadron of Sincerity, Gachi Rangers' Deluxe Belt!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:50.340
The second one
she's gotten
from Ryuuta

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.340
I will now defeat monsters!

00:15:50.810 --> 00:15:52.190
Micchan! Micchan!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:54.300
What is it?

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.660
Hey, what are you trying to do?

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.270
Behaving just like a kindergartener...

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:01.980
It doesn't work...

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:03.730
Oh!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:05.120
The Gachi Belt!

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:06.610
Did you get this from Ryuuta again?

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:12.240
Whoa, it had this sort of gimmick behind it, too?

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:13.570
It doesn't work!

00:16:25.040 --> 00:16:28.440
Another casualty-free day today.

00:16:28.440 --> 00:16:30.580
I'm glad that everything's fine.

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:31.130
Huh?

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:34.620
It seems like there are perverts wandering around here nowadays.

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.140
They'll most probably aim for me, so I must be careful, right?

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:41.630
That's right, you are definitely the type that would be the first to be killed.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:42.800
That's because you're a small-fry!

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:43.390
What...?

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:48.120
Could we stop the savage and brutal talk?!

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:48.880
Please?

00:16:53.230 --> 00:16:54.570
A body entirely covered in blood?!

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:56.710
This is it.

00:16:56.710 --> 00:17:00.040
It was for the sake of this day that I've trained for numerous days...

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.120
to hone this technique to perfection!

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:10.550
Healing Rolling!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.290
Healing Rolling

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:11.300
(Bandage Wrapping Technique)

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:13.750
Here it goes!

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:21.220
Micchan?!

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:23.160
What was that just now?

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.450
Was that her technique's name?

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:25.680
Are you alright?!

00:17:26.390 --> 00:17:27.760
Ah, this isn't good!

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:30.410
I will take her to the infirmary straight away!

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:31.270
Umm...!

00:17:31.270 --> 00:17:33.700
It'll be a pain in the ass, so, let's just leave her be.

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:37.320
But, that's...

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:39.320
INFIRMARY

00:17:44.940 --> 00:17:46.190
I can't...

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.290
...move my body?!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.040
I'm tied up!

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:50.840
Just where am I?!

00:17:51.330 --> 00:17:53.430
What in the world happened?!

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:57.480
It seems like there are perverts wandering around here nowadays.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.590
KIDNAPPING

00:17:58.320 --> 00:17:59.550
Could I have been kidnapped?

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:12.300
I'm going to be shipped out of this country!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.090
At a high price, too!

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:15.600
That's right!

00:18:15.600 --> 00:18:16.870
Where would Sugisaki and the others be?!

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:19.660
Would it be the case that they're with me?!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:24.100
There's no mistake that they're tied up nearby!

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.180
I wonder if they're this way?

00:18:27.300 --> 00:18:28.710
Or this way?

00:18:32.110 --> 00:18:33.060
What's with this?

00:18:33.060 --> 00:18:34.440
I was at a different level?

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:35.260
From a bed?

00:18:35.770 --> 00:18:38.840
Come to think of it, I did fall from a somewhat fluffy place.

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:42.440
So, there wasn't a reaction to that, huh?

00:18:42.440 --> 00:18:44.110
Maybe the criminals aren't here?

00:18:44.630 --> 00:18:46.480
I must try to escape while I still have the chance!

00:18:47.130 --> 00:18:50.890
While I'm at it, I'll try to save Sugisaki and the others.

00:18:50.890 --> 00:18:51.930
Ow! That hurt!

00:18:52.630 --> 00:18:54.270
That would be a dead-end, eh?

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:05.410
What's that?!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:06.910
Was that fur?!

00:19:08.540 --> 00:19:09.920
They've got stray, feral dogs?!

00:19:10.610 --> 00:19:13.200
Stop it! I don't taste any good!

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:14.500
Go away!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.720
That hurts...

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:28.000
Well, at least it made the feral dogs run away.

00:19:28.650 --> 00:19:31.770
Yet, I don't know if or when they may come back.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:34.190
I must hurry and get out of here!

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:35.480
Ow!

00:19:36.070 --> 00:19:38.000
Now, what did I hit this time?!

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:41.970
The abductor?!

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.240
He's back?!

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:07.430
What happened?!

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:08.460
Did he fall over?!

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:09.770
Did he swoon?!

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:12.770
At any rate, it's my chance, now!

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:18.500
Just where are Sugisaki and the others?!

00:20:18.500 --> 00:20:19.980
Are they at another place?!

00:20:19.980 --> 00:20:21.340
I wonder if they're unharmed?!

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:27.460
Someone is coming over!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.580
Were there really more accomplices, after all?!

00:20:29.580 --> 00:20:33.210
SCIENCE PREPARATION ROOM

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:31.670
I better hide or else...

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:37.260
Huh?

00:20:45.020 --> 00:20:45.640
What was that?

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:50.640
No!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:53.730
I'm sorry for forgetting my belongings...

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:56.170
Make sure you notice and realize things like that faster!

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:57.540
Come now, chill out.

00:20:58.690 --> 00:20:59.980
Help!

00:20:59.980 --> 00:21:02.460
Sugisaki's been killed!

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.090
L-Let go of me!

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:05.240
You damn murderer!

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:06.990
They're still at it, eh?

00:21:26.800 --> 00:21:29.300
I'm so glad that you're still alive!

00:21:45.910 --> 00:21:47.510
Erm...?

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:53.160
Anyway, it's great that you're alright.

00:21:53.160 --> 00:21:55.960
Just tie me up... again.

00:22:18.060 --> 00:22:23.150
As the sun sets on the schoolyard

00:22:23.290 --> 00:22:28.420
I waved my hand, and head back home

00:22:28.630 --> 00:22:33.600
Tonight, when I go to bed

00:22:33.770 --> 00:22:38.900
It'd be great if I can see you again

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:44.450
Let's go to sleep

00:22:44.450 --> 00:22:48.400
I can't wait for tomorrow

00:22:50.590 --> 00:22:55.490
It's really wonderful in my dream, you see...

00:22:55.860 --> 00:23:00.390
You can even fly into the sky

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:14.940
My heart aches when I hold your hand, even in my dream

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:20.400
Just like my dream-colored love

00:23:26.730 --> 00:23:27.890
Mitsuba?

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:29.360
Why are you coming onto the preview?!

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:31.890
That's because you haven't punished me enough yet!

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:34.410
Curse me like I'm some milkjug rack, vulgar whore!

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:36.740
Or that I smell as foul as a slug...

00:23:35.610 --> 00:23:40.980
I Can't Reach You

00:23:36.740 --> 00:23:38.120
Degrade me some more, please!

00:23:38.120 --> 00:23:40.980
I can't take this anymore!
